---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Commercial Cleaning Services Phoenix AZ | Diaz Cleaning LLC"
  description="Professional commercial cleaning in Phoenix, AZ. Office cleaning, industrial spaces & more. Reliable & affordable. Call (480) 479-4507."
>
  <main class="service-page">
    <section class="service-hero">
      <h1>Commercial Cleaning Services in Phoenix, AZ</h1>
      <p class="service-subtitle">Keeping Phoenix businesses spotless — offices, retail spaces, industrial facilities and more.</p>
      <a href="/#contact" class="btn-primary">Get a Free Quote</a>
    </section>

    <section class="service-content">
      <h2>Professional Commercial Cleaning in Phoenix</h2>
      <p>A clean workspace improves productivity, leaves a great impression on clients and keeps employees healthy. Diaz Cleaning LLC delivers reliable commercial cleaning services for businesses of all sizes across Phoenix, AZ.</p>

      <h2>Commercial Services We Offer:</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Office cleaning and sanitization</li>
        <li>Retail and storefront cleaning</li>
        <li>Industrial facility cleaning</li>
        <li>Warehouse and factory cleaning</li>
        <li>Building and condominium maintenance</li>
        <li>Post-construction cleanup</li>
        <li>Recurring janitorial services</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Flexible Scheduling for Your Business</h2>
      <p>We work around your business hours — early morning, evenings or weekends. Our goal is to clean your space without disrupting your operations. We serve Phoenix, Glendale, Scottsdale, Tempe, Mesa, Chandler and surrounding cities.</p>

      <h2>Trusted by Phoenix Businesses</h2>
      <p>Diaz Cleaning LLC brings energy, attention to detail and a genuine commitment to every job. We treat your business space like it's our own, ensuring the highest standards of cleanliness every visit.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="service-cta">
      <h2>Let's Keep Your Business Clean</h2>
      <p>Call us at <a href="tel:+14804794507">(480) 479-4507</a> or send us a message for a customized commercial cleaning quote.</p>
      <a href="/#contact" class="btn-primary">Contact Us Today</a>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .service-page {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 4rem 2rem;
    font-family: 'Mulish', sans-serif;
  }
  .service-hero {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }
  .service-hero h1 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: #4a1060;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .service-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: #666;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .service-content h2 {
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #4a1060;
    margin: 2rem 0 1rem;
  }
  .service-content p {
    color: #444;
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .service-content ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .service-content ul li {
    padding: 0.5rem 0;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
    color: #444;
  }
  .service-content ul li::before {
    content: "✓";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: #9b308a;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .service-cta {
    text-align: center;
    background: #f8f0fc;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 3rem 2rem;
    margin-top: 4rem;
  }
  .service-cta h2 {
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    color: #4a1060;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .service-cta p {
    color: #555;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }
  .service-cta a[href^="tel"] {
    color: #9b308a;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .btn-primary {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #9b308a;
    color: white;
    padding: 14px 32px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1rem;
    transition: background 0.3s;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover { background: #4a1060; }
</style>